      "episode": "10956",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "もー、すっかりその呼び方になっちゃったね。 昔みたいに樹お姉ちゃーんって呼んでくれてもいいのに",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_02/adv_voice_eventstory_7_02_056.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c23573ed5595da9b29751fc8a618ab7525caddbe1286c670b7cdb76d754b5e6c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_02_056.wav",
      "subtitle": "真是的，你已经完全改用这个叫法了呢。\n像以前那样叫我『树姐姐——』也可以嘛",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "072d7ca0aa4e57edc18f679a1c4e13dbc1ee5330203d219de72f3765d4bcc4dc",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_02_058",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10956",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "そう！ やっぱ久しぶりの実家はいいね〜。 おっきなソファーに愛しの家族！ ねー、ロイ？",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_02/adv_voice_eventstory_7_02_058.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2c193790def92f6cb8f842b0e60453aa95984ea3fac863cb188b9c52978df707",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_02_058.wav",
      "subtitle": "对呀！好久没回家，果然还是家里好～\n大沙发加上可爱的家人！对吧，罗伊？",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "181ab9dd080355c6dc808816da30ba25f5eaba5467c2fd49e0cc52ff01a81ea2",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_02/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_068",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "言ったでしょ？ うちのバスケ部、すっごい強いとこなの。 だから１年生も上手い子ばっかでさ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_068.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "efd55f3a48b89a8183534c8140ec964a03cfe88648d0954f01e34a1df2a4b884",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_068.wav",
      "subtitle": "我不是说过吗？我们学校的篮球队超级强。\n所以一年级也全是厉害的人",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "fba314bd10812ffff15a1271744489aa081025db7d7b92df250daa0ee0b0fc2c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_069",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "先輩なんてもっと上手だから、 さすがにいきなりレギュラーとかベンチは厳しいよ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_069.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "50340aad178d88d0f21dadf491e92c7ba08cd3dac1350148a94e8c27a326da7c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_069.wav",
      "subtitle": "学姐们就更厉害了，\n别说一上来就当首发，就连进替补名单都太难啦",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "1f2d0003490e3ec7360ea568668b1165e90ea36b516b759dd45efa210cc873b0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_104",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_03",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "あたしの練習が足りないんだって……もっと努力すれば、 がんばれば報われるって信じてた！ なのに！！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03/adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_104.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "8d29933a4f61353056dbd8b2b9e05b6c99690f16af00a521bbc6fa8190a3d2eb",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_03_104.wav",
      "subtitle": "我以为是自己练得还不够……只要更努力，\n只要拼命就会有回报，我一直这么相信！可是！！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "75fe86210ddf791bef8d1b57668db2e977fec820a56dceb55ed4f4788c228473",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_03/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_03-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_06_126",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_7_06",
      "speaker": "itsuki",
      "text": "あたしもこれから水切りやるから、見てて。 それの飛んだ回数で、どっちの勝ちか決めるの",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_7_06/adv_voice_eventstory_7_06_126.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_06/adv_script_eventstory_7_06-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_06-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c3304cdb5f978a85b1c7aee4333ebb381a0de4fce6f2fdcacc853ea97c4cd8e0",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_7_06_126.wav",
      "subtitle": "我现在也来打一次水漂，你们看好了。\n就看它跳了几下，来决定谁赢",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "65e132f842762198e819c956a5e98da1277147a7ca320c268869da779f1166ee",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_7_06/adv_script_eventstory_7_06-Text/adv_script_eventstory_7_06-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
